{
  "_source": "catalyrst-comms GET /scene-bans?place_id=&limit=&offset= (handlers/scene_bans.rs list_bans). That route is signed-fetch gated (SCENE_SIGNER=\"decentraland-kernel-scene\") and is_scene_owner_or_admin gated, so it 404s/401s on the public catalyst edge and cannot be read anonymously from SSR — hence this fixture. The `places` rows the operator can moderate are anchored on LIVE https://catalyst.example.com/places/api/places?limit=8&order_by=most_active (200) so place_id / title / base_position / image are real. The banned-address list per place mirrors the list_bans envelope { results:[{bannedAddress,name}], total, page, pages, limit }; bannedAddress values are synthetic 0x wallets (no real ban records are public) and `name` is the DCL NAME resolved by names.get_names_from_addresses (empty string when unclaimed). Ban/unban commits are SIMULATED.",
